    {
      "id": "q0054",
      "chapterId": "ch05",
      "knowledgePointIds": [
        "kp05-02"
      ],
      "primaryKnowledgePointIds": [
        "kp05-02"
      ],
      "difficulty": "入门",
      "type": "独立编写",
      "title": "客户编号占位",
      "context": "报表要求客户编号缺失时用 -1 占位，方便下游系统识别。",
      "requirements": "输出 orders 的 id，以及客户编号缺失时用 -1 代替的列 client_key。\n输出字段名称及顺序：id, client_key",
      "datasetId": "q0054-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "3.0.0",
      "sourceTables": [
        "orders"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "id",
          "client_key"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            1,
            1
          ],
          [
            2,
            2
          ],
          [
            3,
            1
          ],
          [
            4,
            -1
          ],
          [
            5,
            3
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 5
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,COALESCE(customer_id,-1) AS client_key FROM orders",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,COALESCE(customer_id,-1) AS client_key FROM orders"
        },
        {
          "kind": "独立方法等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,CASE WHEN customer_id IS NULL THEN -1 ELSE customer_id END AS client_key FROM orders",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,CASE WHEN customer_id IS NULL THEN -1 ELSE customer_id END AS client_key FROM orders"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "需要在“有值时用原值、缺失时用默认值”之间二选一。",
        "COALESCE(a, b) 返回第一个不是 NULL 的值，可以用它给 NULL 指定替代值。",
        "核对替代值：题目指定的是 -1，而不是 0。"
      ],
      "explanation": "COALESCE(customer_id,-1) 在 customer_id 有值时返回原值，缺失时返回 -1。占位值要按题目指定，写成 0 容易和真实的编号混淆。\n另一种写法：CASE WHEN customer_id IS NULL THEN -1 ELSE customer_id END，含义一致，只是更啰嗦。",
