      "difficulty": "简单",
      "type": "独立编写",
      "title": "优先选备注后选缺省",
      "context": "客户备注里有 NULL，也有空字符串，展示时都要换成统一的提示文字。",
      "requirements": "输出 id 和 label：note 有实际内容时显示 note，note 为 NULL 或空字符串时显示“无信息”。\n输出字段名称及顺序：id, label",
      "datasetId": "q0060-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "4.2.2",
      "sourceTables": [
        "nullable_values"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "id",
          "label"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            1,
            "无信息"
          ],
          [
            2,
            "无信息"
          ],
          [
            3,
            "ok"
          ],
          [
            4,
            "ok"
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 4
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,COALESCE(NULLIF(note,''),'无信息') AS label FROM nullable_values",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,COALESCE(NULLIF(note,''),'无信息') AS label FROM nullable_values"
        },
        {
          "kind": "独立方法等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,CASE WHEN note IS NULL OR note='' THEN '无信息' ELSE note END AS label FROM nullable_values",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,CASE WHEN note IS NULL OR note='' THEN '无信息' ELSE note END AS label FROM nullable_values"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "两种“没有内容”（NULL 和空字符串）都要被识别为需要替换的情况。",
        "NULLIF(a, b) 在 a 等于 b 时返回 NULL；COALESCE 取第一个非 NULL 的值，两者可以组合。",
        "先把空字符串变成 NULL，再给 NULL 指定替代文字。"
      ],
      "explanation": "NULLIF(note,'') 先把空字符串转成 NULL，COALESCE(…,'无信息') 再把所有 NULL 换成提示文字，两类“无内容”就都处理到了。\n易错：只写 COALESCE(note,'无信息') 只会替换 NULL，空字符串会原样保留。\n另一种写法：CASE WHEN note IS NULL OR note='' THEN '无信息' ELSE note END。",
      "commonErrors": [
        {
          "sql": "SELECT id,COALESCE(note,'无信息') AS label FROM nullable_values",
          "reason": "只替换 NULL 不会处理空字符串，需要先用 NULLIF 把空字符串转成 NULL。",
          "validation": "典型错误已在至少一组夹具被结果/状态比对拒绝"
        }
      ],
